1:p156"],"basis":["distinct-source-identity","Chinese-name-family-office-and-episode-evidence"],"confidence":"high","notes":["The root is Sima Lun’s strategist 孫秀. The peer belongs to the Wu commander 孫秀 tradition: Xiakou command, flight to Jin and Kuaiji dukedom, or comparison with the Wu defector Sun Kai. This royal military career is distinct from Sima Lun’s former petty clerk and strategist.","sanguozhi:051:p156: s0252 泰子秀為前將軍、夏口督。 s0253 秀公室至親，握兵在外，皓意不能平。 s0254 建衡二年，皓遣何定將五千人至夏口獵。 s0255 先是，民間歛言秀當見圖，而定遠獵，秀遂驚，夜將妻子親兵數百人奔晉。 s0256 晉以秀為驃騎將軍、儀同三司，封會稽公。 s0257 〈江表传曰：皓大怒，追改秀姓曰厉。 s0258 干宝《晋纪》曰：秀在晋朝，初闻皓降，群臣毕贺，秀称疾不与，南向流涕曰：“昔讨逆弱冠以一校尉创业，今后主举江南而弃之，宗庙山陵，於此为墟。 s0261 晋诸公赞曰：吴平，降为伏波将军，开府如故。 s0262 永宁中卒，追赠骠骑、开府。"]},"priorReceipt":{"path":"research/people/jinshu053-native-campaign-reviewed-001-006-20261025.json","gitRevision":"1b9c1e4262fcd1e5eef069b867e96f4e9d90be59","rawSha256":"b2b06390e0a9bb5c75b0f7c1e41da57ee7ececdc2dd9872c4cf602d32961cf64","historicalSourceEpoch":"30e2e9700c2494e6e7abcefeb53b19c24f7197c1"}},{"oldPath":"data/people/resolutions/jinshu053-rest-20261025-c004-part-003-30e2e9.json","archiveOrdinal":12,"decisionContentSha256":"1ce96b41531c4f7527a1709603d2cb84b62ad991bb01b8fdc527302fcd9d4b47","candidate":{"decision":"keep-separate","localPeople":["jinshu:053:p059","sanguozhi:065:p081"],"basis":["distinct-source-identity","Chinese-name-family-office-and-episode-evidence"],"confidence":"high","notes":["The root is Sima Lun’s strategist 孫秀. The peer is Wu ruler 孫休/景帝, Prince of Langye and predecessor of Sun Hao, a different name and royal career.","sanguozhi:065:p081: s0179 孫亮即位，諸葛恪輔政，表曜為太史令，撰《吳書》，華核、薛瑩等皆與參同，孫休踐阼，為中書郎、博士祭酒。 s0180 命曜依劉向故事，校定眾書。 s0181 又欲延曜侍講，而左將軍張布近習寵幸，事行多玷，憚曜侍講儒士，又性精確，懼以古今警戒休意，固爭不可。 s0182 休深恨布，語在《休傳》。"]},"priorReceipt":{"path":"research/people/jinshu053-native-campaign-reviewed-001-006-20261025.json","gitRevision":"1b9c1e4262fcd1e5eef069b867e96f4e9d90be59","rawSha256":"b2b06390e0a9bb5c75b0f7c1e41da57ee7ececdc2dd9872c4cf602d32961cf64","historicalSourceEpoch":"